        <mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;b&gt;Willow — the box as MEASURED, v0.5 · 2026-08-29&lt;/b&gt;  &lt;font color=&quot;#888888&quot;&gt;b17: WGRV1  ΔΣ=42&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;Not a plan. Every number here was read off disk, not recalled. Read against &lt;b&gt;willow-v04-full&lt;/b&gt; (2026-07-20), which remains the intent.&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#2e7d32&quot;&gt;green = live&lt;/font&gt; · &lt;font color=&quot;#b97700&quot;&gt;amber = partial / degraded&lt;/font&gt; · &lt;font color=&quot;#c62828&quot;&gt;red = not built&lt;/font&gt; · purple = identity &amp;amp; law · &lt;font color=&quot;#1565c0&quot;&gt;blue = product layer&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="1200" height="70" as="geometry" /></mxCell>

